------------------------------------------------------------------------------

ARES's "Ares" model (tag: legion-ares:qwen3-8b) is NOT an independent
model. It is a local profile created with `ollama create` from the Qwen3-8B
base model using the system prompt in agents/ares/models/Modelfile.ares.

  - Base model: Qwen3-8B
  - Author:     Qwen Team, Alibaba Cloud
  - License:    Apache License 2.0
  - Reference:  https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3  /  https://huggingface.co/Qwen

The Qwen3 base weights are downloaded by the operator from the Ollama registry
at install/provision time; they are not redistributed by this repository. Use of
those weights is subject to the upstream Apache-2.0 license and the Qwen model
terms.

The Ares profile is a smaller, fully-local analyst persona. It is NOT Claude,
Anthropic, or any other third-party assistant, and is instructed never to claim
to be one (see agents/ares/models/Modelfile.ares and
crates/legion-ares/src/knowledge.rs).
